ction":"chapter-021","block":"b-e77897ee41c08c8b3da5","layer":"pei","quote":"毌丘俭反，康有力，且欲起兵应之；以问山涛，涛曰：‘不可。’俭亦已败","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":7,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-1efeb74dbd8165ab96e9","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"康临刑自若，援琴而鼓，既而叹曰：‘雅音于是绝矣！’时人莫不衷之","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":336,"end":367,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-3e8317e684ef04f81d9c","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-455f8a040c6687d7fa70","layer":"pei","quote":"撰录上古以来圣贤、隐逸、遁心、遗名者，集为传赞；自混沌至于管宁，凡百一十有九人","attribution":"裴注·嵇喜《嵇康传》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":182,"end":221,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-43f08281b546f0937cab","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"康寓居河内之山阳县，与之游者，未尝见其喜愠之色。与陈留阮籍、河内山涛、河（南）〔内〕向秀、籍兄子咸、琅邪王戎、沛人刘伶，相与友善，游于竹林，号为‘七贤","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":9,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-4f127dfc424806db8d5f","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-455f8a040c6687d7fa70","layer":"pei","quote":"著《养生篇》","attribution":"裴注·嵇喜《嵇康传》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":137,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-5214d243f3d5a5838a1f","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"安引康为证，康义不负心，保明其事","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":291,"end":307,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-5cc5321dae0aeb4ef61b","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-a046fb14a2b62fb69b98","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞康字叔夜。按《嵇氏谱》：“康父昭，字子远。督军粮、治书侍御史。兄喜，字公穆。晋扬州刺史、宗正。”","attribution":"裴注","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-64f38156d3f83a0b2d3a","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军尝欲辟康。康既有绝世之言，又从子不善，避之河东","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":180,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-793285ab9c8bb838429d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-3e0b70931b4785a29df4","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：《本传》云“康以景元中坐事诛”，而干宝、孙盛、习凿齿诸书，皆云：正元二年，司马文王返自乐嘉，杀嵇康、吕安。盖缘《世语》云康欲举兵应毌丘俭，故谓破俭便应杀康也。其实不然。山涛为选官，欲举康自代，康书告绝，事之明审者也。按《涛行状》，涛始以景元二年除吏部郎耳。景元与正元相较七八年，以《涛行状》检之，如《本传》为审。又《钟会传》亦云会作司隶校尉时诛康；会作司隶，景元中也。干宝云：吕安兄巽，善于钟会，巽为相国掾，俱有宠于司马文王，故遂抵安罪。寻文王以景元四年钟、邓平蜀后，始授相国位；若巽为相国掾时陷安，焉得以破毌丘俭年杀嵇、吕？此又干宝之疏谬，自相违伐也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":0,"end":282,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-a36536b57578c848efec","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-bdf06c7909f72fa21b4f","layer":"pei","quote":"称康临终之言曰：“袁孝尼尝从吾学《广陵散》，吾每固之，不与。《广陵散》，于今绝矣","attribution":"裴注·康别传","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":29,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-abe85848bd9ecd4360c3","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-2d7fb5dbb0a521347abf","layer":"original","quote":"至景元中，坐事诛","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-c93d56f80459b881a0aa","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"钟会劝大将军因此除之，遂杀安及康","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":319,"end":335,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-d83cefc6d632395574f2","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"康采药于汲郡共北山中，见隐者孙登。康欲与之言，登默然不对","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":370,"end":398,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-db09fa4c6689f19bf08e","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-455f8a040c6687d7fa70","layer":"pei","quote":"性好服食，尝采御上药","attribution":"裴注·嵇喜《嵇康传》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":62,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-e6ee7a7d7e63a2eb4d11","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"及遭吕安事，为诗自责曰：‘欲寡其过，谤议沸腾。性不伤物，频致怨憎。昔惭柳下，今愧孙登。内负宿心，外赧良朋","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":436,"end":488,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-efa8b7907db7dd8dbe9a","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-f8ff70bf10d41f3e849e","layer":"pei","quote":"康方箕踞而锻，会至，不为之礼。康问会曰：‘何所闻而来？何所见而去？’会曰：‘有所闻而来，有所见而去。’会深衔之","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-70ad920837cbb5d19ddf","start":124,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0068","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d79396012c5280381c75","layer":"original","quote":"迁司隶校尉。虽在外司〖7〗，时政损益，当世与夺〖8〗，无不综典。嵇康等见诛，皆会谋也。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0444","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d79396012c5280381c75","layer":"original","quote":"嵇康等见诛，皆会谋也","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
